title: 'pallet-revive: build with alloy-trie 0.9.9'
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      `pallet-revive` now compiles with `alloy-trie` 0.9.9. That release adds a public field to
      `HashBuilder`. `pallet-revive` now uses the defaults for the `HashBuilder` fields that it
      does not set.
crates:
  - name: pallet-revive
    bump: patch
